      "text": "Build Layer\n\nVite + TypeScript build\nTailwind/PostCSS styles\nReact plugin transforms JSX\nOutput: /dist\n- index.html\n- hashed JS/CSS assets\n- copied images/icons\n- .well-known/security.txt",
